msgstr "논리 픽셀 단위의 초기 클라이언트 높이. 기본값은 640입니다."

#: cefweaver.ui.toolkits.pywin32.Win32Browser:16 of
msgid "The initial window title. Defaults to ``\"cefweaver pywin32\"``."
msgstr "초기 창 제목. 기본값은 ``\"cefweaver pywin32\"``\\ 입니다."

#: cefweaver.ui.toolkits.pywin32.Win32Browser:18 cefweaver.ui.toolkits.qt.CefWidget:11
#: cefweaver.ui.toolkits.sdl2.SdlBrowser:17 cefweaver.ui.toolkits.tk.CefCanvas:7
#: cefweaver.ui.toolkits.wx.CefPanel:10 of
msgid "The ``audio`` option of :class:`~cefweaver.ui.BrowserView`."
msgstr ":class:`~cefweaver.ui.BrowserView`\\ 의 ``audio`` 옵션."

#: cefweaver.ui.toolkits.pywin32.Win32Browser:21 cefweaver.ui.toolkits.sdl2.SdlBrowser:20
