#: cefweaver.ui.toolkits.pywin32.Win32Browser:43 of
msgid "``(width, height)`` of the last view frame in device pixels."
msgstr "장치 픽셀 단위의 마지막 뷰 frame ``(width, height)``."

#: cefweaver.ui.toolkits.pywin32.Win32Browser:45 of
msgid "``(width, height)`` of the last popup frame."
msgstr "마지막 팝업 frame의 ``(width, height)``."

#: cefweaver.ui.toolkits.pywin32.Win32Browser:47 cefweaver.ui.toolkits.sdl2.SdlBrowser:42 of
msgid "The window title."
msgstr "창 제목."

#: cefweaver.ui.toolkits.pywin32.Win32Browser:49 cefweaver.ui.toolkits.sdl2.SdlBrowser:44 of
msgid "The current address of the page."
msgstr "페이지의 현재 주소."

#: cefweaver.ui.toolkits.pywin32.Win32Browser:51 cefweaver.ui.toolkits.sdl2.SdlBrowser:46 of
msgid "Whether the browser can go back."
msgstr "브라우저가 뒤로 갈 수 있는지 여부."

#: cefweaver.ui.toolkits.pywin32.Win32Browser:53 cefweaver.ui.toolkits.sdl2.SdlBrowser:48 of
